@SPEAR uses all arc interlock channels available on the new arc interlock
module (vacuum and air side for all 4 cavities).  SPEAR uses the arc channel
reserved for MPS.  All arc interlock records moved out of rf_digital*.template
and into rf_stn*.template (where 4CVAll uses all channels).  Arc summaries are
moved out of rf_sumy_(2CV,4CV).db into rf_sumy_arc_(2CV,4CV,4CVAll).db.
@
text
